config TOUCHSCREEN_NT36XXX_ML
	tristate "Novatek NT36XXX touchscreen (mainline port, regmap)"
	depends on SPI
	help
	  Novatek NT36XXX SPI touchscreen driver from the sm7150-mainline tree.
	  It talks through regmap, so transfers are split at the controller's
	  advertised maximum instead of sending one large buffer.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will be
	  called nt36xxx-ml.
